Subject: [PATCH 4.4 42/62] vt: defer kfree() of vc_screenbuf in vc_do_resize()
Date:   Tue,  1 Sep 2020 17:10:25 +0200
Message-Id: <20200901150922.848353509@linuxfoundation.org>
